<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46756" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠθάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, ὁ, ἡ, (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			) <i>accustomed to</i> a thing, <i>acquainted with</i> it,
			c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠ. εἰμί πως τῶν τῆσδε μύθων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					372
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θήρης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					4.122
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν χωρίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					7.6
				</span></i>
			: c. dat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτραις</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				9.36
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs.,
				<i>inured, accustomed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν γὰρ ἠθάδων φίλων νέοι . .
					εὐπιθέστεροι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					818
				</span></i>
			; of animals, <i>tame</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρνιθες]
				ἠ</span>. <i>domestic</i> fowls, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				271
			</span></i>; of decoy-birds, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sull.</u>
				28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠ. σκόμβροι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					14.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of things,
				<i>usual, customary</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νίκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>APl.</u>
					5.354
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάγαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.264
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Apollonid.
			</span></i> or <i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>): as neut., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ καινά γ᾽ ἐκ τῶν ἠθάδων ἡδίον᾽
					ἐστί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					250
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἠθάσι λίαν τοῖς τ᾽ ἀρχαίοις
					ἐνδιατριβειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					584
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				151
			</span></i>.</div>
